1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 18=

2
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,000
Sizhou!

3
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,200
Sizhou!

4
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,040
Sizhou!

5
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,040
Miss Xiaobai.

6
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,040
Yunsheng.

7
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,800
Miss Xiaobai,

8
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,520
what happened to you?

9
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,320
Where's Sizhou?

10
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,630
The First Prince
was summoned to the palace yesterday

11
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,920
and hasn't returned yet.

12
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:38,680
Miss Xiaobai.

13
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,880
Miss Xiaobai!

14
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,000
I want to see Sizhou.

15
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,600
I must see Sizhou!

16
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:51,600
Who is making such a commotion here?

17
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:54,200
I, Jiang Xiaobai, a commoner,

18
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:55,720
wish to see the First Prince, Sizhou.

19
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,110
The imperial palace is forbidden ground.

20
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,720
You can't just enter as you please.

21
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,400
Commoners are forbidden
from entering the palace.

22
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,920
Leave at once.

23
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,400
Let me in.

24
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,200
I must see Sizhou today!

25
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,800
Rules are rules.

26
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,800
Say no more.

27
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,600
Then what must I do to see him?

28
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,000
For a commoner to enter the palace,

29
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:15,400
they must first
endure one hundred strokes.

30
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:17,040
As long as I can see Sizhou,

31
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:19,600
I'll endure the hundred strokes.

32
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,960
You mustn't, Miss!

33
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:23,120
No one can withstand a hundred strokes!

34
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,480
Please don't act rashly.

35
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,800
After a hundred strokes,

36
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,920
even if you survive,

37
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,320
you'll be left barely alive.

38
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,720
Have you made up your mind?

39
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,440
I have.

40
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:33,200
Please make the preparations, sir.

41
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,560
Miss!

42
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,600
You can't!

43
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,200
He Dang.

44
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,040
I've made up my mind. Let go.

45
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,680
You can't, Miss!

46
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,800
Let go!

47
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,360
Open the palace gates.

48
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:08,760
Administer the hundred strokes.

49
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,360
Zhou.

50
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:49,960
Mother.

51
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,160
Jiang Xiaobai insists on seeing you.

52
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:56,840
She's now receiving 100 strokes
as required by the ancestral rules.

53
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,240
Stop.

54
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,360
There are some things I have to tell you.

55
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,800
You are a prince.

56
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,840
From the moment you were born,

57
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:08,990
you've carried
the responsibilities of the imperial family.

58
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,520
Jiang Xiaobai is just like me.

59
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,960
You know full well how much hardship

60
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,760
and suffering

61
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,960
I've endured in this life.

62
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,840
If you want
Jiang Xiaobai to end up like me,

63
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,320
suffering the same pain

64
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,520
or even losing her life,

65
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,640
then go to her.

66
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,120
If you truly love her

67
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,560
and want her to live in peace,

68
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,600
then you should leave her.

69
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,920
I won't let something like this

70
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,600
happen to her.

71
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,160
Your father said
the same thing back then!

72
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,760
Letting go

73
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,950
is how you protect the one you love.

74
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,760
Whether you preserve your love

75
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,400
or preserve her life,

76
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,160
the choice is yours.

77
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:35,380
♪Frost chills the courtyard♪

78
00:05:36,490 --> 00:05:38,830
♪The lamp burns out,
leaving two shadows side by side♪

79
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:42,430
♪On the eve of parting, we still
face each other through the brief night♪

80
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,060
♪As it slowly lengthens♪

81
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:49,040
♪Before we're old,
our hair has turned white♪

82
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:52,640
♪Before we wake, the dream has faded♪

83
00:05:53,130 --> 00:05:54,850
♪A moment
of warmth lingers at our fingertips♪

84
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,980
♪I dare not hold on,
for fear it will end in sorrow♪

85
00:06:00,090 --> 00:06:03,280
♪You spoke
of the days ahead, but I know this♪

86
00:06:03,410 --> 00:06:04,960
♪Life has grown cold♪

87
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:09,920
♪Half a promise dies
upon my lips, swallowed by tears♪

88
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:14,100
♪Deep within♪

89
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:17,580
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

90
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:21,180
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

91
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:24,220
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

92
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:28,260
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

93
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:31,540
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

94
00:06:31,740 --> 00:06:34,330
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

95
00:06:34,350 --> 00:06:37,090
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

96
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,240
Sizhou.

97
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,840
You came.

98
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:42,480
I knew you wouldn't refuse to see me.

99
00:06:44,860 --> 00:06:46,120
Don't come looking for me again.

100
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,440
I never loved you.

101
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,880
Not even a little.

102
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,760
You're lying.

103
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,480
You're lying!

104
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,480
You said you loved me.

105
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,680
You said you loved everything about me.

106
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,920
Have you forgotten everything you said?

107
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,560
That was
nothing more than a passing fancy.

108
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,680
Stop clinging to this.

109
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,040
No. That's not true.

110
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,160
You still owe me one wish.

111
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,680
I want you to tell me the truth.

112
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,480
Tell me the truth, Sizhou.

113
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,320
I'm sorry.

114
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,080
I broke my promise.

115
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,040
You're lying!

116
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,280
Don't go, Sizhou!

117
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,080
Sizhou!

118
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,760
Sizhou!

119
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:51,100
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

120
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:55,330
Don't go, Sizhou!

121
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:58,300
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

122
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:01,270
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

123
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:04,130
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

124
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:07,760
♪I'll only say that once♪

125
00:08:07,790 --> 00:08:11,830
♪I called your name♪

126
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:18,920
Uncle.

127
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,760
There's something
I'd like to discuss with you.

128
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,760
Go ahead.

129
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:23,880
I'd like

130
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,360
to see Xiaobai one more time.

131
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,640
Your wedding is just around the corner.

132
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:33,960
You shouldn't be running around anymore.

133
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,320
After the wedding,

134
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,280
I'll learn

135
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:38,990
every ceremony
and protocol required of me.

136
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:42,240
From then on, every moment of my life,

137
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:44,720
I'll put the imperial family
and Sizhou first.

138
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,960
I'll become the Rousang

139
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,160
that all of you want me to be.

140
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,160
But Xiaobai is my only friend.

141
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,160
This is my final wish.

142
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,160
Just this once,

143
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,640
Uncle.

144
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,240
You must be back before the Xu hour.

145
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,680
Don't let anyone see you.

146
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,640
They won't.

147
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:13,760
I promise.

148
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,320
Please raise your hand, Your Highness.

149
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,000
80 centimeters.

150
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,720
116 centimeters.

151
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,480
Whether you preserve your love

152
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,120
or preserve her life,

153
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,880
the choice is yours.

154
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,040
Get out.

155
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,120
But Your Highness ordered me to...

156
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,000
Get out!

157
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,560
Your Majesty,

158
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,480
in a few days,

159
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,240
it will be Sizhou's grand wedding.

160
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,520
Sizhou

161
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,360
is compassionate

162
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:21,800
and kindhearted.

163
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,600
When he inherits the throne,

164
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:28,240
everyone in the realm,

165
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:29,590
from the people to the officials,

166
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,200
will remember his kindness

167
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,040
and yours as well.

168
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,680
It's just that

169
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,040
he is far too softhearted.

170
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,920
Whatever happens,

171
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:46,360
he always tries to please everyone.

172
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:48,640
As a result,

173
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,720
he can easily be swayed by others.

174
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,360
But that's all right.

175
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:58,560
I am his mother, after all.

176
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:02,720
I can still guide him and make sure
he knows how to handle things.

177
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,440
With me by his side to assist him,

178
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:13,480
I won't let anyone with ulterior motives

179
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,560
take advantage of him.

180
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,360
Your Majesty,

181
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,240
rest easy.

182
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:32,420
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

183
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,280
Xiaobai,

184
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,520
I bought a few

185
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,680
of your favorite pastries.

186
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:55,880
Xiaobai,

187
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,000
did you keep
the jade pendant I gave you?

188
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,040
Why is the window open?

189
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,440
You

190
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:10,000
must remember to keep it closed.

191
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:12,360
Otherwise, the drafts will get in,

192
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,560
and you'll easily fall ill.

193
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,120
Xiaobai,

194
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:46,520
you must keep
this jade pendant with you at all times.

195
00:12:47,660 --> 00:12:48,730
In the entire realm,

196
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:50,140
there isn't another one like it.

197
00:12:52,820 --> 00:12:55,350
I've made arrangements
with several food shops.

198
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,860
As long as you have this jade pendant,

199
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:58,100
you can buy whatever you like.

200
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,640
All right.

201
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,820
If there's nothing else,

202
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:06,920
I'll be going now.

203
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:13,840
Rousang.

204
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:17,560
Is there something else
you haven't told me?

205
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:21,640
No.

206
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,240
(Xiaobai,)

207
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,920
(I cannot defy my elders' wishes.)

208
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:42,840
(This is my fate.)

209
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,280
(Please don't blame me.)

210
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:50,680
By the Mandate of Heaven,

211
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,600
the Emperor hereby decrees.

212
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:55,080
Prince Sizhou

213
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,680
has reached the age of marriage.

214
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,794
Rousang, the legitimate daughter
of the distinguished Luan family,

215
00:13:59,795 --> 00:14:01,480
is hereby appointed his Princess Consort.

216
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,840
The grand wedding ceremony
shall be held tomorrow.

217
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,640
For three days following the wedding,

218
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,840
the people of Bojue
shall hang lanterns in celebration.

219
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:11,560
Let the whole realm rejoice.

220
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:13,640
This decree is hereby proclaimed

221
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:16,280
for all under Heaven to know.

222
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,680
♪The candle
burns down to its final glow♪

223
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:30,040
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

224
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,440
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

225
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:35,360
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

226
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,240
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

227
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:43,920
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

228
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,080
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

229
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:49,560
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

230
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:55,200
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

231
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:58,800
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

232
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,840
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

233
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:05,880
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

234
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:09,160
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

235
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:12,240
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

236
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,960
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

237
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:18,200
♪I'll only say that once♪

238
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,440
♪I called your name♪

239
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,280
♪The silent stars hang low♪

240
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:30,880
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

241
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:34,040
♪I linger in the old tower♪

242
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:37,800
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

243
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,560
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

244
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:45,240
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

245
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,240
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

246
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:54,480
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

247
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,640
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

248
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:01,720
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

249
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:04,360
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

250
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:08,640
♪Now only
fading warmth remains in my palm♪

251
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,560
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

252
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,720
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

253
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:17,400
♪If we meet again in another life♪

254
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:20,440
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

255
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:23,400
♪Was when we first met?♪

256
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:27,080
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

257
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,960
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
